      "title": "How to get better on Thor?",
      "notes": "<p>Thor abilities:</p><p></p><p><strong>First ability:</strong> use quick cast. (If you are comfortable with aiming ruler, you can use instant cast. Otherwise use quick cast just in case that if you forgot the range of your wall, you can press 1 to check it out.)</p><p><strong>Second ability: </strong>use <strong>instant cast</strong>. (get use to it and your Thor will be on an another level)</p><p><strong>Third ability: </strong>use quick cast</p><p><strong>Ult: </strong>use it more often or even on cooldown.</p><p></p><p><strong>Combo 1: </strong>2-1-AA-3 (use this combo if you are far from your target)</p><p><strong>Combo 2: </strong>AA-3-2-1-AA (use this combo if you are close to your target)</p><p><strong>Combo 3: </strong>1-AA-3-2-AA (Need some practice to hit the double tap without wall stun)</p><p><strong>Combo 4:</strong> 4-AA-1-AA-2-AA-3 (Only use this combo if you hit the enemy with the centre of your ult, and the enemy have no escape abilities)</p><p><strong>Combo 5:</strong> 4-1-2-AA-3 (use this combo if u hit the enemy with the edge of your ult)</p><p><strong>Combo 6: </strong>4-AA-3-2-1-AA (use this combo if the enemy has an escape ability. Use your 2-1 after the enemy using their escape abilities.)</p><p></p><p></p>",
